# HoleControl ControlBallReleased (0x426ee0): tabc34 only in mode 2 with the hole's field 0; field 1 or another mode: no sound.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 10
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
200 poke info_text_box message_field 2
201 poke s_hole118 message_field 0
205 event s_hole118 ControlBallReleased
205-205 expect sound 32
210 poke s_hole118 message_field 1
215 event s_hole118 ControlBallReleased
215-215 expect none sound 32
220 poke s_hole118 message_field 0
221 poke info_text_box message_field 7
225 event s_hole118 ControlBallReleased
225-225 expect none sound 32
260 quit
